{"slug":"extension-1","fork":"Blockchains/extension-1","upstream":"polkadot-js/extension","branch":"master","commit":"54f44022004f4cefb4a2b929f3a397715a134d6f","indexed_at":"2026-10-04T16:39:25Z","category":"polkadot","description":"Simple browser extension for managing Polkadot and Substrate network accounts in a browser. Allows the signing of extrinsics using these accounts. Also provides a simple interface for compliant extensions for dapps.","readme_summary":"A very simple scaffolding browser extension that injects a @polkadot/api Signer into a page, along with any associated accounts, allowing for use by any dapp. This is an extensible POC implementation of a Polkadot/Substrate browser signer. As it stands, it does one thing: it _only_ manages accounts and allows the signing of transactions with those accounts. It does not inject providers for use by dapps at this early point, nor does it perform wallet functions where it constructs and submits txs to the network. - On Chrome, install via Chrome web store - On Firefox, install via Firefox add-ons 1. Uncompress `master-ff-src.zip` 2. Run `corepack enable` More information 3. Install dependencies via `yarn install` 4. Build all packages via `yarn build` - The `/packages/extension/build` directory will contain the exact code used in the add-on, and should exactly match the uncompressed `master-","install_commands":[],"languages_bytes":{"TypeScript":548659,"JavaScript":2600},"file_count":403,"total_bytes":27799202,"licenses":[{"path":"LICENSE","detected":"Apache-2.0","head":"Apache License Version 2.0, January 2004 http://www.apache.org/licenses/ TERMS AND CONDITIONS FOR USE, REPRODUCTION, AND DISTRIBUTION 1. Definitions. \"License\" shall mean the terms and conditions for "}],"license_spdx_github":"Apache-2.0","spdx_headers":{},"packages":[{"ecosystem":"npm","name":"@polkadot/extension-base","version":"0.64.1","path":"packages/extension-base/package.json","private":false,"description":"Functions, classes and other